From 1fbb052f0a810b9d7ff4f268a2f4052c6e2c2e4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 03:11:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] v1.31.0: grabber auto-downloads on finish, 3yr default,
 parallel rooms, Ctrl+Alt+X shortcut
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Grabber saves each room's messages to Downloads the moment it finishes
  (no Export button, no Stop button, no date picker).
- Defaults to 3 years back from the real date.
- Multiple rooms grab in parallel — start one, switch tabs, start another.
- New keyboard shortcut Ctrl+Alt+X starts a grab on the front room tab.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
